  m_text: '<size=180%><color=#ffd970><b>LANTERN ZOO</b></color></size>

    Every
    asset in this project, laid out at its <b>real imported size</b>. Compare against
    the blue 2 m player figure - you''ll spot scale problems instantly!


    <b>Teleport</b> 
    1 UModeler props   2 Animals & animations   3 Nature   4 Furniture   5 Materials  
    6 Effects   7 Audio   0 Hub

